[29.4137, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[2;87H\u203a \u001b(B\u001b[mThis is a public terminal demo of independent Codex discussion forks. The topics a\u2026 \u001b[2m\u001b[3;87H\u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[mReady to discuss three independent design topics.\u001b[K\u001b[4;87H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n  Worked for 5s \u2022 14:01                                                               \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[6;87H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[2B\u203a \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: CLI surface.\u001b[K\u001b[9;87H  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions.  \u001b[10;87H  Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks  \u001b[11;87H  you to implement changes.\u001b[K\u001b[12;87H\u001b[K\n  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[K\u001b[14;87H  In English, suggest two ways to simplify overlapping CLI commands. Start your       \u001b[15;87H  answer with CLI:. Max 30 words. Do not use tools.\u001b[K\u001b[16;87H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[2B\u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[mCLI: Merge commands that perform the same action, using options for variations.     \u001b[19;87H  Standard\u001b[K\u001b[9;3H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
